 # Greeting
 
-`greet(name)` in `src/greet.js` returns `Hello, <name>.` — the name, ending with a full stop.
+`greet(name)` in `src/greet.js` returns `Hello, <name>.` — the name, ending with a full stop. The name is capitalised with
+`titleCase` from `src/text.js`: each word starts upper-case and the rest is lower-case, so
+`ada LOVELACE` gives `Hello, Ada Lovelace.`.
diff --git a/src/greet.js b/src/greet.js
